{"reply":"Thanks, Jeffrey, I found your vehicle. Your 2021 Halden is outside the basic (3 years / 60,000 km) and powertrain (5 years / 100,000 km) warranty limits. Only the corrosion coverage (7 years) is still in force. I can't tell what the warning means or whether it's covered. The warranty desk decides that after an inspection.

There is also an open recall on your car, NM-24R01: the rear camera image may not display. The fix is a software update of about 45 minutes, and parts are available. Recall work is at no cost to you.

Would you like me to send a warranty review request to the warranty desk for the flashing yellow warning light? It's a request only, not an approval.","action":"asked_clarification","escalation_reason":"none","summary":"","policy_rules_cited":["P02","P05","P08"]}
